Job URL: {{ $('Loop jobs').item.json.url }}

Find ONE specific fact: a real product name, a growth metric, a recent milestone, or their stated mission phrase. Use your knowledge of this company.

If you have no specific knowledge of this company, reply with exactly: NO_FACT_FOUND

Return only the single sentence fact, nothing else.

